{{About|the passive skill|the monster modifier|Executioner's Presence}}
{{Passive skill box|Executioner}}

'''Executioner''' is a [[notable passive skill]] that grants increased damage with [[Hit|hits]] against enemies that are on [[low life]], as well as increased [[Area of effect|Area of Effect]] if you have killed [[recently]].

