* {{Undocumented}}
**Now grants {{c|mod|60% increased Damage with Hits against Enemies that are on Low Life}} (up from 50%).
**Now grants {{c|mod|15% increased Area of Effect if you've Killed Recently}} (up from 12%).
**No longer grants {{c|mod|24% increased Physical Damage with Two Handed Melee Weapons}}.
**No longer grants {{c|mod|Attacks with Two Handed Melee Weapons deal 24% increased Damage with Ailments}}.

}}
{{Version history table row|3.11.0|
*''Many passive skill clusters offered the same thing as other clusters, with the only differences being the location on the tree and the number of passive skills in the cluster. We also wanted to reduce the power of some clusters that were overly efficient, and increase the power of clusters that were inefficient.''
